TITLE: The shared-understanding plan's tech-debt register
DEPTH: interface-settled
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The linchpin every tech-debt item in this plan points at. A debt item is a
WORK node at sketch that Assumes this register AND Assumes the work item
whose landing produced it, so it surfaces in the Plan tab under both. The
register holds no list: the edges are the list, and reviewing the new debt
means reading this node's inbound edges.
<<<
